WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.520
If you take injectable GLP-1 medications or other weight-loss drugs such as

2
00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:08.480
phentermine, there's an important step to be aware of before your procedure.

3
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:08.840
These

4
00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:13.360
medications slow digestion, which can affect how your stomach empties and may

5
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:17.520
interfere with your prep. For that reason, your care team may ask you to hold

6
00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:17.680
your

7
00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:22.600
GLP-1 before your colonoscopy. Typically, you will need to hold your dose for

8
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:22.760
1

9
00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:26.240
week, but if you are not sure, please call your doctor's office to confirm

10
00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:30.920
exactly when to take your last dose. Do not stop or adjust any medication

11
00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:31.160
without

12
00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:34.960
speaking with them first. We just want to make sure everything goes smoothly on

13
00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:37.640
procedure day.
